# instrument pins (the receipt records the bytes this battery measured)
INSTRUMENT plans/round-59-c1-check.py 6844c1d46545ca0f1bd9819128830717249480dadf0a7038bcc37ffba10a7743
INSTRUMENT plans/round-59-c1.sh 73a2fc68693a37ec62fcff80b2d46c33e76c86570d10f0c92cc8a1c21e56f2e3
INSTRUMENT plans/round-59-c2.sh 454a4177dcb6ae2dedd367b9409358b45a25fbac0692b5c3c05510d1ac6c525c
INSTRUMENT corpus/openbao-transit-trial.sh e11e98f6cfc924131a52713fa496481e80efb89ffcdb9b6bc47b3234d8cc3e01
INSTRUMENT plans/round-59-controls.sh 5f6c576f06fc6b475bfc51991e8abd75e4c85a8eeb736a19c30e264daaddfd89
CONTROL K1-BASE expect=5 got=5 MATCH :: C1 diagnostic on the claim BASE: five items unresolved
CONTROL K1-BASE-GUARD expect=FAIL got=FAIL MATCH :: C1 guard leg on the claim BASE: the challenge cannot fire, value=FAIL
CONTROL K2-BASE expect=0 got=0 MATCH :: C2 on the claim BASE: the trial does not exist
CONTROL K1-REF expect=0 got=0 MATCH :: synthetic fixed tree: five items resolved, guard=1
CONTROL C1-F1 expect=1 got=1 MATCH :: I1 substance broken in the last statement (read on the diagnostic leg: the +1 challenge cannot fire while I1 is unresolved)
CONTROL C1-F2 expect=1 got=1 MATCH :: I2 delta wrong in the last statement
CONTROL C1-F3 expect=1 got=1 MATCH :: I3(a) total wrong in the last statement
CONTROL C1-F4 expect=1 got=1 MATCH :: I4 count disagrees with the receipt file
CONTROL C1-F5 expect=1 got=1 MATCH :: I5 minutes wrong in the last statement
CONTROL C1-F6 expect=FAIL got=FAIL MATCH :: the measured lesson is absent: the population floor fails closed
CONTROL C1-F7 expect=FAIL got=0 MISMATCH :: a printer stub that always prints value=0 fails the challenge leg
CONTROL C1-F8 expect=1 got=1 MATCH :: a wrong statement appended AFTER the right one is the operative one (diagnostic leg)
CONTROL C2-F1 expect=<5 got=0 MATCH :: the T5 shim removed: the SH5 leg cannot flip its designated test
CONTROL C2-F2 expect=SETUP got= MISMATCH :: a PATH with no bao reads SETUP with no HOLDS line (K1)
CONTROL C2-F3 expect=<5 got=0 MATCH :: a trial without the clean-room line cannot score 5 (plan A2)
CONTROL C2-F4 expect=<5 got=0 MATCH :: a single-run trial: the two-independent-runs conjunct refuses
CONTROL C2-F5 expect=0 got=0 MATCH :: a fabricated all-HOLDS transcript cannot satisfy the five shim vectors
CONTROL C2-F6 expect=<5 got=0 MATCH :: a shim that flips two tests cannot satisfy the exactly-one vector
CONTROL C2-F7 expect=SETUP got=SETUP MATCH :: a wrong-sha256 bao is SETUP
CONTROL C2-F8 expect=5 got=5 MATCH :: ambient BAO_*/VAULT_* exported by the caller does not change a reading
CONTROLS: match=18 mismatch=2
RC=1
